gm10d
=====

gm10d contributors
    Modern daemon, MQTT/Home Assistant integration, Prometheus metrics,
    USB/native TTY support, and corrected byte-accurate event counting.

Historical foundation
---------------------

Mathias Bavay
    Author of gm4lin. gm10d uses gm4lin 1.2.15 as the authoritative
    reference for the Black Cat Systems GM-10/GM-45 Linux serial setup,
    including 57600 8N1 operation and DTR detector power control.

Stephen A. Misel
    Contributor to the historical gm4lin MySQL logging implementation.
